{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122712","id":4337899925,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAo8ZlQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122712","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122712.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122712.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122712","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122712/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122712/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122712/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1938234e02178b1d8b2ab7c9500b12f59a2bfa6d","number":122712,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(audio): add voice processing support and microphone input improvements","user":{"login":"urmoit","id":89414990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NDE0OTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89414990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit","html_url":"https://github.com/urmoit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- **Lacks Platform-Level Voice Processing:** Godot previously lacked built-in support for hardware/OS-level voice processing features like Acoustic Echo Cancellation (AEC), Noise Suppression (NS), and Automatic Gain Control (AGC), making real-time voice chat susceptible to background noise and feedback loops.\r\n- **Audio Capture Jitter and Buffer Precision Limitations:** Microphone input internally relied on `int32_t` precision, creating unnecessary format conversions and precision overhead. Applications also lacked a built-in mechanism to buffer capture jitter without causing stutters or audio dropouts.\r\n- **Limited Input Diagnostics:** Games and applications had no clean built-in method to monitor live input peak levels or query whether an input device was operating in mono without manual buffer inspection.\r\n\r\n## Solution Overview\r\n\r\n- **Platform Voice Processing:** Exposed platform AEC, NS, and AGC settings via `ProjectSettings` configuration and programmatic `AudioServer` controls across supported platforms (macOS/iOS, Android, and Web).\r\n- **Float Precision Buffer:** Upgraded the internal audio input pipeline from `int32_t` to native 32-bit `float` processing for cleaner signal processing and parity with output buffers.\r\n- **Jitter Control:** Introduced `AudioStreamMicrophone.playback_delay_ms` to allow users to trade latency for capture jitter robustness.\r\n- **Input Diagnostics:** Added `AudioServer.get_input_peak()` for input level metering and `AudioServer.is_input_mono()` for device topology checks.\r\n- **Driver Updates:** Refactored CoreAudio, PulseAudio, WASAPI, OpenSL ES, and Web audio drivers to feed normalized floating-point samples to the engine.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- **Special Attention Needed:** Driver maintainers should verify buffer alignment for OpenSL and WASAPI driver fallbacks when platform FX filters are disabled.\r\n- **Tested Platforms:** Verified audio capture and FX toggling on macOS, iOS, Android, Web, and Windows.\r\n- **AI Disclosure:** AI was used to assist in formatting and structuring this PR description. All underlying code changes and driver updates were authored and tested manually.","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-22T10:31:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T11:36:27Z","closed_at":"2026-08-23T21:21:25Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"43b09edf769addb16243e1f3a8547586535e6958","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"urmoit:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":1342288261,"node_id":"R_kgDOUAGxhQ","name":"godot","full_name":"urmoit/godot","owner":{"login":"urmoit","id":89414990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NDE0OTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89414990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit","html_url":"https://github.com/urmoit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/urmoit/orgs","r